{"applicability_conditions":"适用于 n 型半导体（氧化物膜）；该式由式(4)在空间电荷电容远小于 Helmholtz 电容的条件下简化得到。","identity":{"block_id":"b0065","equation_id":"equation_005","equation_number":"5","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\frac {1}{C _ {\\mathrm{SC}} ^ {2}} = \\frac {2}{\\varepsilon \\varepsilon_ {0} \\mathrm{e} N _ {\\mathrm{D}}} \\left(E - E _ {\\mathrm{fb}} - \\frac {\\mathrm{k} T}{\\mathrm{e}}\\right) (\\mathrm{n-typesemiconductor})\\tag{5}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.corsci.2025.113331"},"latex":"\\frac{1}{C_{\\mathrm{SC}}^{2}} = \\frac{2}{\\varepsilon \\varepsilon_{0} \\mathrm{e} N_{\\mathrm{D}}} \\left(E - E_{\\mathrm{fb}} - \\frac{\\mathrm{k} T}{\\mathrm{e}}\\right) (\\mathrm{n\\text{-}type\\ semiconductor})","purpose":"Mott–Schottky 公式在 n 型半导体情况下的形式，用于由空间电荷层电容 C_SC 随外加电位 E 的变化关系，求取平带电位 E_fb 与施主密度 N_D。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"氧化物膜的空间电荷层电容（space charge capacitance）","symbol":"C_{\\mathrm{SC}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"半导体的相对介电常数","symbol":"\\varepsilon","unit":null,"value":"15.6"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"真空介电常数","symbol":"\\varepsilon_{0}","unit":"F/m","value":"8.85 \\times 10^{-12}"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"电子电荷","symbol":"\\mathrm{e}","unit":"C","value":"1.6 \\times 10^{-19}"},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"施主密度（对应 n 型半导体的载流子密度）","symbol":"N_{\\mathrm{D}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"外加电位（applied potential）","symbol":"E","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"平带电位（flat band potential）","symbol":"E_{\\mathrm{fb}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"玻尔兹曼常数","symbol":"\\mathrm{k}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"绝对温度","symbol":"T","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["Mott-Schottky 曲线中正斜率表示 n 型半导体行为，其特征缺陷为阳离子间隙和氧空位；负斜率表示 p 型半导体行为，其特征缺陷为阳离子空位。","LDSs 表面氧化物膜的施主或受主密度越大，腐蚀过程中该氧化物膜越容易受损。"]}